---
import Township from '../layouts/Township.astro';
import { officials } from '../data/township';
---
<Township title="About the township">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>About Fernhollow Township</h1>
    <p>Fernhollow Township is a fictional township used to demonstrate Nest Co.'s website work. The details here are invented.</p>
    <h2>Who to contact</h2>
    <ul class="people">{officials.map((o) => <li><strong>{o.name}</strong>{o.role}</li>)}</ul>
    <h2>What the township does</h2>
    <p>The township maintains local roads, runs fire and EMS service, administers zoning, keeps the cemetery and holds public meetings.</p>
  </div>
</Township>
